# The E2E workflow restores a verified copy of the JDBC driver here from its
# cache (.github/workflows/test-e2e.yml, #1109). The workload client build
# uses it only when its SHA-256 matches the pinned one
# (test/workload/client/Dockerfile). Nothing here except this file is
# committed; the directory exists so that the build can always copy it.
*
!.gitignore
